### 2.6 `barGeometry.mjs` (spec: `01-bar-system.md` §2–§7, `foundations/05` §3)
`Ctx` = `{ desktopMode: "tiling"|"floating", revealed: boolean, windowsOverlap: boolean, barFocusActive: boolean, settingsPreview: boolean }`.

| Export | Contract |
|---|---|
| `effectiveVisibility(bar, desktopMode): "always"\|"autohide"\|"dodge"` | `auto` → `dodge` in tiling, `always` in floating |
| `isShown(bar, ctx: Ctx): boolean` | `always` → true; `revealed \|\| barFocusActive \|\| settingsPreview` → true; `autohide` → false; `dodge` → `!windowsOverlap` |
| `extent(bar): int` | `thickness + edgeGap(bar)` |
| `exclusiveZone(bar, shown, desktopMode): int` | `reserveSpace && shown && effectiveVisibility !== "autohide" ? extent : 0` |
| `stackOffsets(bars: Bar[], shownIds: string[]): {[id]: int}` | per edge, in config order: offset = sum of `extent` of earlier **shown** bars on that edge |
| `insets(bars, shownIds): {top, right, bottom, left}` | per edge: max(`offset + extent`) over shown bars; 0 when none |
| `maxInsets(bars): {top, right, bottom, left}` | `insets` with every enabled bar shown |
| `lengthPx(bar, avail: int, implicit: int): int` | `full` → `avail − 2·endGap`; `fit` → `min(implicit, avail − 2·endGap)`; percent `p` → `min(round(avail·p/100), avail − 2·endGap)` |
| `alignOffset(bar, avail, size): int` | `full` → `endGap`; else `start` → `endGap`, `center` → `round((avail − size)/2)`, `end` → `avail − size − endGap` |
| `regions(bars, shownIds, screen: {width, height}, lengths: {[id]: int}): Rect[8]` | Slot `edgeIndex·2 + stackIndex` (edges `top, right, bottom, left`); rect from the screen edge to the bar's inner edge, along `lengthPx` at `alignOffset`; unused slots `{x:0, y:0, width:0, height:0}` |

