### 2.9 `popoverPlacement.mjs` (spec: `primitives/04` §1)
| Export | Contract |
|---|---|
| `placePopover({ edge, origin: Rect, card: {width, height}, screen: {width, height}, insets, gap }): { x, y, originX, originY }` | Screen-local coordinates. `top`: `y = insets.top + gap`, `x` = origin centre − `width/2`, clamped to `[insets.left + gap, screen.width − insets.right − gap − width]`. `bottom`: `y = screen.height − insets.bottom − gap − height`, same `x`. `left`: `x = insets.left + gap`, `y` = origin centre − `height/2`, clamped vertically the same way. `right`: mirror of left. `none`: top-end corner `x = screen.width − insets.right − gap − width`, `y = insets.top + gap`. `originX/originY` = the origin centre projected onto the card edge that faces the bar, clamped to the card (the `Scale` transform origin). `none` has no bar: `originX = width`, `originY = 0` (the card grows from its top-end corner). |

### 2.10 `wheel.mjs` (spec: `foundations/04` §3)
| Export | Contract |
|---|---|
| `wheelStep(acc: number, ev: {angleDeltaY, pixelDeltaY, inverted}, opts: {stepAngle, stepPixels, physical}): {acc, steps}` | Use `pixelDeltaY` with `stepPixels` when it is non-zero, else `angleDeltaY` with `stepAngle`. Negate the delta when `opts.physical && ev.inverted`. `acc += delta`; `steps = Math.trunc(acc / step)`; `acc -= steps · step`. Positive steps = wheel up = increase. Callers pass `Tokens.metrics.wheelStepAngle` (120) and `touchpadStepPixels` (40) and reset `acc` to 0 on hover exit. |

