## 7. Surface Contract (`surfaces/<x>/<Root>.qml`)

| Concern | Rule |
|---|---|
| Visibility | `visible: <state expression>` (lane value, `NotificationService.toasts.length > 0`, …) |
| Screen | per `01-architecture.md` §3 |
| Layer config | the row of `01-architecture.md` §4, verbatim |
| Escape | `Keys.onEscapePressed: { const c = ShellState.handleEscape(inlineDepth); if (c === "inline") collapseInline() }`; each surface keeps `property int inlineDepth` |
| Focus on open | keyboard/IPC open → first control gets focus and `Tokens.keyboardModality = true`; pointer open → nothing pre-focused (except the launcher search field and the lock/polkit password fields, which always take focus) |
| Motion | spatial via `SpringAnimation` + `Tokens.motion.spring*Spatial`, gated by `spatialMotionEnabled`; effects via `durationMs` |
| Side effects | call service functions only (G08) |
| Accessibility | every interactive element named; live values in `Accessible.description`; announcements via `Accessible.announce()` where the spec asks |
